":null,"discountRate":"1","currencyPrice":0.0485,"currencySymbol":"$","isForeignDiscount":null,"ladderLevel":null}],"productImages":["https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20221228_YXC-Crystal-Oscillators-X322512MSB4SI_C9002_front.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20221228_YXC-Crystal-Oscillators-X322512MSB4SI_C9002_back.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20221228_YXC-Crystal-Oscillators-X322512MSB4SI_C9002_blank.jpg"],"edaSvgInfo":{"schSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/2e83b68c877909257b07a0358bddc1b8.svg?t=1727316839","pcbSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/9e297fbdb6c24ee39419d7ac96617dbf.svg?t=1727316839"},"faqs":[{"question":"What are the primary frequency and package specifications of the YXC X322512MSB4SI crystal?","answer":"The X322512MSB4SI is a surface-mount quartz crystal in a 3.20mm × 2.50mm × 0.70mm package. The manufacturer specifies that this crystal family supports frequencies from 8MHz to 64MHz, with available load capacitance options including 10pF, 20pF, or customer-specified values, as well as frequency tolerance and frequency stability options that vary by ordering code. Designers should verify the exact electrical specifications for the selected part number before finalizing a design."},{"question":"Which applications can use the X322512MSB4SI crystal?","answer":"The X322512MSB4SI is intended for frequency control and timing applications. The manufacturer identifies applications including IoT devices, smart wearable products, and communication equipment. When designing with the crystal, the surrounding oscillator circuit should be implemented according to the requirements of the host device and the crystal's specified electrical characteristics."},{"question":"How do temperature and aging affect the long-term performance of the X322512MSB4SI?","answer":"Like other quartz crystals, frequency varies with operating temperature. The manufacturer specifies a maximum aging characteristic of ±3ppm per year, while the available frequency stability specification depends on the selected ordering option. Designers should confirm the required stability grade for their application before selecting the device."},{"question":"What package information is provided for PCB design of the X322512MSB4SI?","answer":"The X322512MSB4SI uses a 3.2mm × 2.5mm four-pad surface-mount package. The manufacturer provides package dimensions and a recommended land pattern to support PCB footprint design and assembly. Following the recommended mechanical footprint helps ensure proper mounting and soldering during PCB assembly."},{"question":"Why is the X322512MSB4SI suitable for timing applications?","answer":"The X322512MSB4SI uses a compact 3.20mm × 2.50mm surface-mount package and belongs to a crystal family intended for IoT devices, smart wearable products, and communication equipment. Multiple frequency and electrical specification options are available within the family, allowing designers to select the version that best meets their timing requirements. Final performance depends on choosing the appropriate ordering option and using the device within the manufacturer's specified operating conditions."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/a84bd8d530dd46e4b0f6d0ee59d8a89c.pdf?productCode=C9002","authenticationList":["ROHS 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj1778548","fileName":"无源晶振_ROHS认证_ YXC(扬兴晶振).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/b661bfb47725e6a4ab557b469ba5b2cd.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj862896","fileName":"ROHS认证(英文版)_全量通用_YXC(扬兴晶振).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/8abbf33549d6531311ea80e0eb4c2629.zip"}],"productDescEn":"Crystal 12MHz ±10ppm 20pF SMD3225-4P","productIntroEn":"Crystal 12MHz ±10ppm 20pF SMD3225-4P","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_10877_s","paramName":"频率稳定度","paramNameEn":"Frequency Stability","paramValue":"±20ppm","paramValueEn":"±20ppm","paramValueEnForSea